  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "What if Erling Haaland had been born in Argentina instead of Norway?",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "ERLING HAALAND",
        "sub": "Norway · since 2019",
        "pill": "WHAT IF HE WAS ARGENTINIAN?",
        "person": "haaland"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Real world first. Haaland made his Norway debut in September twenty nineteen.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "haaland",
        "label": "Debut: 5 September 2019",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He is Norway's all-time top scorer, and he hit sixteen goals in qualifying alone.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "Haaland, World Cup qualifying",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "16",
            "l": "goals"
          },
          {
            "n": "8",
            "l": "wins from 8 for Norway"
          }
        ],
        "person": "haaland"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But his first major tournament only came this summer, at the twenty twenty-six World Cup.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "FIRST TOURNAMENT",
        "body": "Norway's first World Cup since 1998. Haaland scored in every game until the quarter-final."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Norway knocked out Brazil, then lost to England after extra time.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "score",
        "home": "nor",
        "away": "eng",
        "hs": 1,
        "as": 2,
        "date": "11 July 2026",
        "comp": "World Cup quarter-final",
        "note": "after extra time"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Trophies with Norway so far? Zero.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "ZERO TROPHIES",
        "person": "haaland",
        "color": "red"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Now look at Argentina in exactly the same years.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "timeline",
        "items": [
          {
            "year": "2021",
            "label": "Copa América"
          },
          {
            "year": "2022",
            "label": "Finalissima"
          },
          {
            "year": "2022",
            "label": "World Cup"
          },
          {
            "year": "2024",
            "label": "Copa América"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Copa América, Finalissima, World Cup, then the Copa América again.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "cup",
            "label": "Copa América 2021"
          },
          {
            "kind": "cup",
            "label": "Finalissima 2022"
          },
          {
            "kind": "worldcup",
            "label": "World Cup 2022"
          },
          {
            "kind": "cup",
            "label": "Copa América 2024"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And this summer they reached the World Cup final again, losing one-nil to Spain after extra time.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "score",
        "home": "esp",
        "away": "arg",
        "hs": 1,
        "as": 0,
        "date": "19 July 2026",
        "comp": "World Cup final",
        "note": "after extra time"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So in this alternate world, Haaland leads the line for Argentina.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "haalandarg",
        "label": "ALTERNATE WORLD",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That's four trophies instead of none, and that's before we even touch the final.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "whatif",
        "title": "Haaland's international trophies",
        "real": {
          "label": "Norway (real)",
          "value": "0"
        },
        "alt": {
          "label": "Argentina (imagined)",
          "value": "4+"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Could his goals have won Argentina that final too? We will never know.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "quote",
        "person": "haalandarg",
        "text": "Give me the ball in the final."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Would Haaland have been a world champion? Tell me in the comments.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "Same player, different passport",
        "left": {
          "person": "haaland",
          "label": "Norway",
          "value": "0"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "haalandarg",
          "label": "Argentina",
          "value": "4"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow for more, and play Road to Ballon d'Or at knowitball dot co dot uk.",
